\begin_layout Enumerate
The column FC2(RF) represents the construction of two artificial features using the Grammatical Evolution feature construction technique 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand citep
key "fc1"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
 The Radial Basis Function (RBF) machine learning model was employed for feature construction,
 while the generated features were evaluated using Random Forests.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
The column FC2(MLP) stands for the construction of two artificial features using the same feature construction technique.
 The evaluation of the constructed features was performed using a neural network trained with the BFGS method.
